# Check out every text file with LF line endings on every OS. The mandate lock and the skill
# hashes are SHA-256 over exact file bytes; Git for Windows' default CRLF conversion would
# change those bytes and latch MANDATE_HASH_MISMATCH.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Preserve the pre-registered H6b specification SHA256 byte for byte.
research/registrations/clo256_h6b_v1.md -text
